    - rid: 5520813321165733975
      type: {class: DialogNodeData, ns: NodeTree, asm: Hiileike.Nodetree}
      data:
        Guid: hello
        Position: {x: 300, y: 100}
        HasSeen: 0
        Conditions: []
        ConditionFailBehavior: 0
        DialogText: 'ROWAN

          Welcome to the practice yard! I am testing
          the same walking and stair movement as you.'
        TypingTickClip: {fileID: 0}
        FontAsset: {fileID: 0}
        FontSize: 26
        FontColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
        FontStyle: 0
        TextSpeed: 0
    - rid: 5520813321165733976
      type: {class: DialogNodeData, ns: NodeTree, asm: Hiileike.Nodetree}
      data:
        Guid: course
        Position: {x: 600, y: 100}
        HasSeen: 0
        Conditions: []
        ConditionFailBehavior: 0
        DialogText: 'ROWAN

          Try the green box for a short jump. The orange
          box is deliberately too tall. My patrol takes me up the stairs, through
          the doorway, and back around.'
        TypingTickClip: {fileID: 0}
        FontAsset: {fileID: 0}
        FontSize: 26
        FontColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
        FontStyle: 0
        TextSpeed: 0
    - rid: 5520813321165733977
      type: {class: DialogNodeData, ns: NodeTree, asm: Hiileike.Nodetree}
      data:
        Guid: bye
        Position: {x: 900, y: 100}
        HasSeen: 0
        Conditions: []
        ConditionFailBehavior: 0
        DialogText: 'ROWAN

          Catch me again whenever you like. I will pick
          up my patrol where we stopped.


          Use your interaction button
          to continue; Escape or controller Back/Cancel closes this conversation.'
        TypingTickClip: {fileID: 0}
        FontAsset: {fileID: 0}
        FontSize: 26
        FontColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
        FontStyle: 0
        TextSpeed: 0
